==Spanish==

===Etymology===
{{etyl|la|es}} {{term|somnus|lang=la}} and {{term|somnium|lang=la}}. Compare Portuguese {{term|sono|lang=pt}}, {{term|sonho|lang=pt}} and Italian {{term|sonno|lang=it}}, {{term|sogno|lang=it}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈsweɲo/|lang=es}}

===Noun===
{{es-noun|m}}

# [[sleepiness]]
#: ''[[tengo|Tengo]] [[mucho]] '''sueño'''.''
#:: I am very sleepy.
# [[dream]]
#: ''[[realizo|Realizo]] mi '''sueño'''.''
#:: I have fulfilled my dream.

